.Dd November 16, 2026
.Dt DIFF 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm diff
.Nd compare two text files
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl u
.Ar file1 file2
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility compares two text files and prints their line differences.
.Pp
With
.Fl u
it prints a unified diff with
.Pa a
and
.Pa b
headers.
Without it, the normal
.Sq c ,
.Sq d
and
.Sq a
form is used.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
0 when the files are identical, 1 when they differ, 2 for usage or an I/O error.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr cmp 1
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
